1
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,880
他们怎么会没接到我们的预订
How the hell did they lose our reservation.

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:06,096
老爸 你跟老妈结婚三十年
Dad, you were married to mom for thirty years.

3
00:00:06,096 --> 00:00:07,506
只不过是再睡几天沙发而已
It's just a couple of nights on the couch.

4
00:00:07,506 --> 00:00:08,567
我要给会议主办方打电话
I'm gonna call for the Con.

5
00:00:08,567 --> 00:00:12,140
让酒店退9.95元的无线网费用
I'm gonna try to squeeze them on that $9.95 wifi fee.

6
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:12,960
不就是在卖空气嘛
They're selling air.

7
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:16,060
橱柜展销会是北美橱柜行业
ClosetCon is the premier north American trade show

8
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,140
第一大展销会
for the closet industry.

9
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,140
我几年前开始不再参加
I stopped going years ago

10
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,766
因为这是"出"柜行业的展销会
'cause it's a trade show for the closet industry.

11
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:22,600
谢谢
Thank you.

12
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,880
会议安排得实在太棒了
This schedule is incredible.

13
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:26,460
老爸 10点45有一个关于
Dad, there's a 10:45 session

14
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:27,800
永续材料的会议
on sustainable materials.

15
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,381
我们一定得去
We have got to hit that.

16
00:00:29,746 --> 00:00:32,973
但是跟11点的镶板研讨小组冲突了
Mm, but it overlaps with the 11:00 a.m. panel on paneling.

17
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:36,060
还有鞋架分会
And a breakout session on shoe storage.

18
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:36,620
给你点小建议
Little advice --

19
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,480
那些会议都是给菜鸟开的
the convention floor is for suckers.

20
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,780
真正的工作都是在酒吧里完成的
All work is done at the bar --

21
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,980
除非托尼和蕾拉在唱流行歌曲
Unless Tony G. and Layla are singing standards,

22
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:44,540
那样的话 别工作了 尽情欣赏吧
in which case, no work -- prepare to be entertained.

23
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,780
老爸 我是来这里学习的
Dad, I came here to learn,

24
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:46,900
不是上酒吧喝酒的
not sit at the bar and drink.

25
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:48,160
你爱干嘛干嘛 我要去喝杯威士忌
You do what you want. I'm getting a scotch.

26
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,280
我该去认识认识大家
Well, I do need to meet everybody.

27
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,300
好棒啊 吃早餐
Ooh, good. Breakfast.

28
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,760
还早餐呢 叫午餐比较合适吧
Breakfast? Try lunch.

29
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:59,240
-我们农场人起床早 -必须的
- We wake up early on the farm. - Sure do.

30
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,740
城里来的贪睡小耗子终于起来了
There's our sleepy city mouse.

31
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,900
我来帮你戴餐巾
Let's get you all squared away here.

32
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:05,828
我自己来 不用了 我自己来
Yeah, I-I got it. No, I got it.

33
00:01:05,828 --> 00:01:06,660
放下面 这样就好 没事了
Down here. I'm good. I'm good. Now, I know --

34
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:08,240
我都忘了
You know, I forgot how

35
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:09,900
这里有这么多农活要干了
much work there was to be done around here.

36
00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:11,200
我上午一直在修栅栏[双关:改善关系]
I've been mending fence all morning.

37
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,860
一直在修 真的吗
Been mending, have you?

38
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:15,320
密苏里
Missouri.

39
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:15,720
痛苦之地
Misery.

40
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:21,521
-好大的猪圈啊 -真可爱
- What a pig sty, huh? - Cute.

41
00:01:21,521 --> 00:01:23,400
老爸去城里了 他要到晚饭时候才回来
Daddy went to town, he's gonna be there till super,

42
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:24,480
所以我在帮妈妈喂猪
so I'm helping mama slop the pigs.

43
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,780
你要来贡献点力量吗
You want to -- you want to pitch in?

44
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:28,020
不知道 我刚刚吃了培根 所以
I don't know, I just ate that bacon, so...

45
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:29,330
去喂猪似乎不太合适
How's that gonna look?

46
00:01:29,421 --> 00:01:31,618
要不要敲响开饭铃 小超声波
Want to ring the dinner bell, "Little bomber"?

47
00:01:31,820 --> 00:01:33,440
那说起来很古雅呢
Oh, that's actually really quaint.

48
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:36,933
是那种小三角形状的...
Is it one of those little triangle thi--

49
00:01:42,127 --> 00:01:45,640
三郡范围内最响亮的吆喝
Loudest call in the tri-county area.

50
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,580
再来一次
Do it again!

51
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:48,380
不要了 亲爱的 一次就够了
No, sweetheart. I think once was enough.

52
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:55,920
还真有畜生朝这声音跑来的
There's actually an animal that runs toward that sound, huh?

53
00:02:09,860 --> 00:02:10,980
你们好啊
Hello, hello!

54
00:02:11,219 --> 00:02:14,354
-你预约了吗 -预约了 7点的
- Did you make the reservation? - Yeah, 7:00.

55
00:02:16,134 --> 00:02:18,640
跟这个小家伙一起享用牛排晚餐
Fun family time with this little newsy

56
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:19,720
度过美好的家庭时光
and a steak dinner.

57
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:23,160
谁说去参加橱柜大会的人才有美好时光
Who says people at the closet convention get all the fun?

58
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:25,040
没人 没人那么说
No one. No one says that.

59
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:26,620
我告诉你 我去开门时
I am telling you, the way he looked at me

60
00:02:26,620 --> 00:02:28,380
他看着我的样子 绝对是迷上我了
when I came to the door -- it is so on.

61
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:30,180
看起来就是他来送披萨
Kind of seemed like he was just delivering pizza,

62
00:02:30,180 --> 00:02:31,040
你得付钱的样子呗
and you were giving him money.

63
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,240
你们在说什么呢
What are you guys talking about?

64
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,900
查克 昨晚送披萨的小伙子
Chuck, the pizza guy from last night.

65
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:35,240
他害羞但是很体贴
He's shy and thoughtful

66
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,780
穿着一件普林斯顿运动衫
and wears a Princeton sweatshirt --

67
00:02:37,220 --> 00:02:37,800
完全不是海莉喜欢的型
Hardly Haley's type.

68
00:02:37,860 --> 00:02:39,660
天呐 你爱上他了
Oh, my God. You love him.

69
00:02:39,660 --> 00:02:42,020
什么 才没有 你怎么会说我爱上他
What? No! I d-- how would you say I love him?

70
00:02:42,020 --> 00:02:43,260
他才来过家里三次
He's been to our house exactly three times.

71
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,940
太荒谬了 海莉 别看我
That's ridiculous, Haley! Don't even look at me.

72
00:02:44,940 --> 00:02:45,660
太傻了
This is so stupid.

73
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:47,760
她爱上他了
She loves him.

74
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,220
曼尼汉子 照相日怎么样
Hey, "Manimal." How was picture day?

75
00:02:50,220 --> 00:02:51,420
你知道什么对我帮助最大吗
You know what's super-helpful?

76
00:02:51,420 --> 00:02:53,440
就是站在你后面的家伙叫你"大汗山"
When the guy in line behind you calls you "Mount Sweatmore."

77
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:54,680
我那是想让你放松点
I was trying to relax you.

78
00:02:55,820 --> 00:02:56,740
多简单的梗
It was right in front of you

79
00:02:56,740 --> 00:02:57,800
应该叫"布拉德·皮特汗渍"
-- "Brad Pitt-Stains."

80
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,380
-真不给力 卢克 -没关系啦
- Come on, Luke. - It's okay.

81
00:03:00,540 --> 00:03:01,560
新的安保系统吗
New security system?

82
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:02,700
你可以看到后院
You can see the backyard,

83
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,500
前门 车库 全都看得到
the front door, the garage -- everywhere.

84
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:06,460
是啊 自从老妈生下
Yeah, can't take any chances

85
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:07,680
那边那颗希望钻石
since mom gave birth to

86
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,740
家里就不能冒任何风险
the hope diamond over there.

87
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:14,020
杰家里的厨房边上有一个房间
There is a room off the kitchen at Jay's house

88
00:03:14,020 --> 00:03:15,080
总是锁着
that's always locked.

89
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,840
我每次过去都要试着开一次
I try it every time I'm there.

90
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:19,720
我花了无数时间 幻想那个房间里
I've spent countless hours imagining that that room

91
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:21,320
藏着一屋子的宝藏
is a house of treasure...

92
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:24,260
一座充满奇迹的宫殿
a palace of ceaseless wonder.

93
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:26,480
是真的
It's real.

94
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:29,840
你好啊 老朋友
Hello, old friend.

95
00:03:31,100 --> 00:03:32,920
看到那个了吗
Would you look at that?

96
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:35,980
什么 简直太棒了
What?! That's coconuts!

97
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,120
不是吧
No!

98
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:41,520
那是
Is that --

99
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:43,420
阿波罗13号的复制品
A replica of Apollo 13.

100
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,680
瞧这细节
Look at the detail.

101
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,200
你都能看到宇航员在里头
You can almost see the astronauts

102
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,760
喝超小杯的果珍
drinking teeny, tiny Tang.

103
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:49,900
-能让我拿一下吗 -不行
- Can I hold it? - No.

104
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,960
你知道这有多珍贵吗
You have any idea how valuable this is?

105
00:03:52,020 --> 00:03:53,620
你的手指上还有芝士粉末
And your fingers are covered in cheese dust.

106
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:55,060
这样
There.

107
00:03:55,060 --> 00:03:56,987
-别 卢克 拜托 -你俩别闹了
- No! Luke, please! - Hey, guys. Knock it off.

108
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,660
别担心 歌洛莉亚 我能行
Don't worry, Gloria. I got it.

109
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,520
大家都别慌
Nobody panic!!

110
00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:05,920
这可是收藏家版本 40年历史呢
This is a collector's edition. It's 40 years old!

111
00:04:05,940 --> 00:04:06,680
我们得立即修复它
We're gonna have to improvise.

112
00:04:07,660 --> 00:04:09,600
歌洛莉亚 给牛排馆打电话取消预约
Gloria, call the steakhouse and cancel.

113
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:11,900
曼尼 找些胶水来
Manny, find some glue.

114
00:04:12,180 --> 00:04:14,040
卢克 我们把这些零部件都拿到车库
Luke, let's get these parts into the garage.

115
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:15,560
我知道这看起来很困难
I know this seems impossible,

116
00:04:15,580 --> 00:04:16,500
但我们一定能行
but we can do this!

117
00:04:16,900 --> 00:04:18,420
是休斯顿牛排馆吗[休斯顿火箭中心]
Hello. Houston's?

118
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:19,660
我们出了点状况
We have a situation.

119
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:23,020
我们是参加橱柜展的 哪都能进
Hi. We're with ClosetCon. All-access.

120
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:25,160
她不在乎 你是唯一戴着牌子的笨蛋
She doesn't care. You're the only dope wearing that here.

121
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:27,080
-快给我 -不 我喜欢
- Give it to me. - No. I like it.

122
00:04:27,900 --> 00:04:28,700
好啊 乔尔
Hey. Joel.

123
00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:30,000
看起来不错啊 老朋友
Looking good, my friend.

124
00:04:30,740 --> 00:04:32,420
在自动化橱柜上洗澡
Took a bath on automated closets.

125
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,360
人们还没准备好呢
People aren't ready for that.

126
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:36,360
杰·普里契特 帅哥快过来
Jay Pritchett. Get your cute butt over here.

127
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,980
-她是谁 -一位老朋友
- Who's that? - An old friend.

128
00:04:38,060 --> 00:04:40,160
我去打个招呼 你去拿两杯酒来吧
I'm gonna go say hello. Why don't you get us a couple drinks?

129
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,240
好 我这就去
Yeah. I'll do that.

130
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:46,320
能给我一杯威士忌和一杯白葡萄酒吗
Hi. Can I get a scotch and a white wine?

131
00:04:46,660 --> 00:04:47,800
人真多 好吵啊
Wow, rowdy crowd, huh?

132
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:49,580
展销会嘛 人们离开家人
Trade shows -- people get away from their families,

133
00:04:49,700 --> 00:04:51,220
-喝点小酒 -我懂的
- get a little liquored up. - Yeah, I get that.

134
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:53,360
你挂上了名牌
Let's just say when the nametags go on,

135
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,200
就该摘下婚戒了
the wedding rings come off.

136
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,920
我不大同意那点
I am not so on board with that.

137
00:04:56,740 --> 00:04:57,620
好啊美女
Hey, there.

138
00:04:57,948 --> 00:04:59,211
经典
Classy.

139
00:04:59,991 --> 00:05:02,907
我帮你理理领带 看起来真帅
Let me just fix this. You're looking so great.

140
00:05:06,192 --> 00:05:07,680
我妈妈比较以自我为中心
My mom was pretty self-involved,

141
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,140
而我爸经常出差
and my dad traveled a lot for work.

142
00:05:09,140 --> 00:05:12,347
我的确想过... 你懂的
So, yeah, I did wonder if... you know.

143
00:05:12,579 --> 00:05:14,203
我不是要责怪他
And not that I could blame him.

144
00:05:14,758 --> 00:05:16,220
但每天我朋友艾莉森放学时
My friend Alison's mom

145
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:18,040
她妈妈都会用一个大大的拥抱
greeted her every day after school

146
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,960
和笑容迎接她
with a big hug and a giant smile,

147
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,540
我总是想 "是啊
And I always thought, "Yeah...

148
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,460
那样也挺不错的"
wouldn't mind a piece of that."

149
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:26,520
-要这样做吗 -我下午带去你房间里
- So, are we doing this? - I'll bring it to your room this afternoon.

150
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:30,520
对于新来橱柜展的人 我们有个小传统
We have a little tradition at ClosetCon for rookies,

151
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:31,620
今年是克莱尔
which Claire is this year.

152
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:34,540
我们把一具骨架藏在他们的橱柜里
We take a skeleton. We hide it in their closet.

153
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:36,720
他们打开柜门 然后大声尖叫
They open the door and scream,

154
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:38,420
我们大家都哄堂大笑
and we all have a good laugh.

155
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:40,360
这主意不是我们想出来的
Can't take full credit for the idea.

156
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:41,760
是从壁橱展上学的
We stole it from CabinetCon.

157
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:43,960
热苹果酒
Hot cider.

158
00:05:44,180 --> 00:05:46,080
好 谢谢你 巴布
Oh, yes. Thank you, Barb.

159
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,360
-太感谢你了 -外面好冷
- Thank you so much. - It's chilly.

160
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,440
这酒真带劲
Mmm. Wow, that's got a kick.

161
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:50,220
那是朗姆酒的力道
That'll be the rum.

162
00:05:50,660 --> 00:05:53,140
我能感受到它温暖你的小肚肚
I can feel it warming up your belly.

163
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,600
还在我嘴里和喉咙里呢
Yeah, still in my mouth and throat.

164
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,560
那是什么
Well, what's that?

165
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,361
开始变冷了啊
Boy, it starting to get nippy, huh?

166
00:05:57,500 --> 00:05:59,040
你们想走去野鸭池塘吗
You guys want to walk down to the duck pond?

167
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:01,447
听起来挺不错的 我去拿枪
Um -- that sounds lovely. I'll get the gun.

168
00:06:01,447 --> 00:06:03,936
-大家伙儿都来吗 -大家伙儿
- Are y'all coming? - "Y'all"?

169
00:06:03,989 --> 00:06:06,020
-我们不说大家伙儿 -我们说的
- We don't say "Y'all"! - Yeah, we do.

170
00:06:06,020 --> 00:06:09,120
我们在这里说 但一般不说
No, well, yeah, we say it... here, but not normally.

171
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:11,120
你觉得我其实是这样说话的
Well, did you ever think this is how I really talk

172
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:13,580
我离开这里时 说的话就不一样了吗
and that I talk different-like when I'm not here?

173
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:14,520
大家伙儿在吵架吗
Y'all fighting?

174
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:16,540
不不 亲爱的 我们只是在聊天
No, no, sweetie, we're just having a conversation

175
00:06:16,540 --> 00:06:18,460
聊你二爸有多么高傲
about how your daddy can be so stuck-up.

176
00:06:18,460 --> 00:06:19,460
小卡 你真"成熟"
Cam, that's really mature.

177
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:21,480
利用我们的女儿来挖苦我
Use our daughter to get your little digs in.

178
00:06:21,580 --> 00:06:22,840
我绝不会那样做的 亲爱的
I would never do that, sweetie.

179
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,940
你觉得我没发现
You don't think I notice

180
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:25,600
我们来这里后你有多高傲吗
how condescending you are when we come here?

181
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:27,740
你"作"在门廊上 翻白眼
You just set on the porch. You roll your eyes.

182
00:06:27,780 --> 00:06:28,860
什么也不参与
You don't participate in anything.

183
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:29,780
对 我说的是"作"
And, yeah, I said "Set."

184
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:31,160
但我们这里就是这样说话的
But that's how we talk here.

185
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,240
这里是我的家乡 我为它感到骄傲
I'm from this place. I'm proud of this place.

186
00:06:33,300 --> 00:06:36,100
我很难过我爱的人觉得这是个大笑话
And it hurts me that the man I love just thinks it's some big joke.

187
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:36,620
走吧 亲爱的
Come on, sweetie.

188
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:39,302
仁慈的主啊
Lord a'mercy.

189
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,520
我饿死了 晚餐怎么办啊
Ugh. I'm starving. What are we gonna do about dinner?

190
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:49,180
我问过爸爸了 订了几块西奥家的匹萨
I checked with dad, and I ordered a couple pizzas from Theo's.

191
00:06:49,180 --> 00:06:51,220
我就知道 你在跟踪我的匹萨帅哥
I knew it! You're stalking my pizza guy!

192
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:53,020
他不喜欢你 好吗
He is not into you, okay?

193
00:06:53,020 --> 00:06:54,060
他叫过你"棕眼姑娘"吗
Does he call you "Brown eyes"

194
00:06:54,060 --> 00:06:55,340
多给过你酥炸芝士条吗
and give you extra mozzarella sticks?

195
00:06:55,380 --> 00:06:57,060
够了 你俩
Okay, that's it, you two!

196
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,920
你们不能像争珠宝或者鞋子一样争男人
You cannot fight over men like it's jewelry or shoes.

197
00:07:00,060 --> 00:07:02,580
如果你俩都喜欢他 谁也不许去追
If you're both interested, no one makes a move.

198
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:04,120
姐妹第一 男人第二
Sisters before misters!

199
00:07:07,064 --> 00:07:08,566
-跟踪狂 -荡妇
- Stalker! - Trollop.

200
00:07:08,577 --> 00:07:10,326
不知道那是什么意思
Ha-ha, don't know what it means --

201
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,740
-你做了什么 -我没做什么
- What did you do?! - Nothing!

202
00:07:12,740 --> 00:07:14,680
就是你 你把它打开了
Aah! Yes, you did! You turned it on,

203
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,020
现在螺旋桨都缠在一起了
and now the propeller's all tangled up!

204
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:16,940
我为什么要那样做
Why would I do that?

205
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:18,300
因为我的匹萨帅哥就要来了
'cause my pizza guy is coming,

206
00:07:18,300 --> 00:07:19,600
现在我头发里有一架飞机
and now I have airplane in my hair!

207
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:21,260
我发誓我没有 海莉
I swear I didn't, Haley. Okay.

208
00:07:21,260 --> 00:07:23,080
我来帮你弄出来 天啊
I'll get it out. Oh, my god, ow!

209
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:24,760
-发生什么了 -我不知道
- What is happening?! - I don't know!

210
00:07:25,673 --> 00:07:28,857
你找到了一个小玩具吗
Ohh, you find a little toy?

211
00:07:29,780 --> 00:07:31,200
刚在车道上
Hey, was that aunt Marge

212
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,420
横冲直撞的是玛吉姑妈吗
just tearing down the driveway?

213
00:07:32,420 --> 00:07:34,980
对 她带来了一份小"礼物"
Yes. And she dropped off a little present.

214
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:37,820
这是我的小卡卡吗
Is that my Cam Cam?

215
00:07:37,820 --> 00:07:40,192
-奶奶 -你好啊
- Gram gram! - Oh, you.

216
00:07:40,192 --> 00:07:41,900
最近发布了风暴预警
There have been some storm warnings,

217
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:43,940
玛吉觉得她在这里更加安全
so Marge thought she'd be safer over here.

218
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:45,320
但她很快让她下了车
But she dropped her off so fast

219
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:48,060
我们都没时间整理一下[straight暗指直男]
that we didn't even have a chance to straighten up.

220
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:50,360
我们从没和奶奶说基佬的事
We never told gram about the gay.

221
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:52,140
他们年事已高
You know, after they reach a certain age,

222
00:07:52,140 --> 00:07:52,760
可能听到了这件事
you worry that it could

223
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,240
一激动就一命呜呼了
be the thing that sends them over the edge,

224
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,760
而她已经随时都可能驾鹤西去了
And she's been on the edge for a long time.

225
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,520
实际上她排在二号临终床上
We're actually on deathbed number two.

226
00:07:59,180 --> 00:08:00,440
米奇尔 米奇尔
Mitchell. Mitchell.

227
00:08:00,579 --> 00:08:02,060
好吧 这怎么回事
Okay. W-what's this?

228
00:08:02,060 --> 00:08:05,180
这是我准备好去喂猪 打包或者挤奶了
This is me ready to slop, bale, or milk something.

229
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:05,980
你没必要这样做
You don't need to do that.

230
00:08:05,980 --> 00:08:07,520
不 小卡 我知道
No, I -- Cam, I-I know.

231
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:10,080
我知道我对你真实的一面过于苛责
I know I gave you hell for being who you really are,

232
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:11,860
-我想补偿你 -好吧 但你知道吗
- and I want to make that up to you. - Yeah, but you know what?

233
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:14,260
穿上我姐姐的周日工作服就足够了
Putting on my sister's Sunday overalls is gesture enough.

234
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:16,200
-这是什么 -我咀嚼的稻草
- What's this? - Oh, it's my chewing straw.

235
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:18,620
-这不是稻草 -这只是作秀啦
- It's not straw. - Oh, it's just show -- for show.

236
00:08:18,620 --> 00:08:20,160
-别过去 别过去 -你爱这个男人
- Hey. Come on, come on. - You know, you love the man,

237
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,620
-要爱他的家乡 -是 但你知道吗
- you love the world he comes from. - Yeah, but you know what?

238
00:08:21,620 --> 00:08:23,920
我不知道是这套农场装还是其它的缘故
I don't know if it's these farming clothes or what,

239
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,400
此时此刻我觉得和你好亲近
but I am feeling so close to you right now.

240
00:08:26,473 --> 00:08:28,140
-这话真贴心 -快亲我一下
- Well, that's so sweet. - Now give me a kiss.

241
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:28,800
不行 现在不行
No, not right now.

242
00:08:28,933 --> 00:08:30,995
别逼我扑倒你
Well, don't make me rassle you down.

243
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:33,660
这人是谁
Who's this?

244
00:08:34,100 --> 00:08:34,960
惨了
Oh, dear.

245
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:38,471
奶奶 这位是巴德 新来的农工
Uh...well, grams, this is Bud, our new farmhand.

246
00:08:39,060 --> 00:08:39,500
巴德
Bud?

247
00:08:39,500 --> 00:08:41,139
是的 巴德脑袋被驴踢过
Yeah, Bud's a little simpleminded

248
00:08:41,139 --> 00:08:44,240
所以脑子有点不好使 是不是
on account of getting mule-kicked, isn't he?

249
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,220
巴德 你该知道你是不能进屋的
And you know the rules on being in the house, Bud.

250
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,160
快出去吧
Now, go on outside.

251
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:49,477
我们过一会儿还得挤牛奶呢
We're gonna milk the cows in a few minutes.

252
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:51,980
出去挤奶吧 挤完请你吃饭
Get on out there. Have a treat afterwards.

253
00:08:54,660 --> 00:08:56,020
所有零件都在这里了
Here's what we've got to work with.

254
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:58,080
干得漂亮 我已经和佛罗里达州连线了
Nicely done. I've got Florida on the line.

255
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,620
爸 我把你放到这里 你是模型专家
Dad, I'm flying you in. You're the model expert.

256
00:09:00,620 --> 00:09:02,220
儿子 我们要组装什么东西
What are we looking at, son?

257
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:04,720
我的神呐
Holy Moses.

258
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:07,761
这是碎成1300块的阿波罗号啊
More like Apollo 1,300 pieces!

259
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:11,100
看来太空里的人没有什么幽默感
In space, I guess no one can hear you be hilarious.

260
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,180
我需要你专心一点
I need you to focus.

261
00:09:12,180 --> 00:09:13,851
-万一杰看到这个... -我知道了
- If Jay sees this... - I know!

262
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:16,040
爸 这里三个好男人全都靠你了
Dad, you've got three good men here depending on you.

263
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:17,822
不多说了 我现在要按一个键
Say no more -- I'm gonna tap a button now

264
00:09:17,822 --> 00:09:18,740
可能会把我屏幕上
that's either gonna make you

265
00:09:18,740 --> 00:09:20,120
你们的影像放大 或者
larger on my screen or --

266
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:23,060
我们和佛罗里达失去联系了
We've lost Florida.

267
00:09:24,020 --> 00:09:26,080
现在就把骷髅架拿过来 我刚到房间
Yeah, yeah. Bring the skeleton up now. I just got to the room.

268
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:27,340
你好呀 爸
Hey, dad.

269
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:28,720
你好 女儿
Hey, honey.

270
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,840
我还以为我们是约在餐厅见呢
I thought we were meeting at the restaurant.

271
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,900
没错 那场演讲结束得有些早
Yeah, well, the lecture got done a little early,

272
00:09:32,900 --> 00:09:35,080
而且我似乎成了今晚的明星
and I was kind of the star of the evening.

273
00:09:35,300 --> 00:09:37,840
我杜撰出来一个词引得全场爆笑
I got a huge laugh when I coined the phrase

274
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,440
"柜尊"[与自尊近似]
"Shelf-esteem."

275
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,960
好笑吧
Huh? Yeah?

276
00:09:41,500 --> 00:09:42,480
我得发短信告诉菲尔
Okay, I'll text it to Phil.

277
00:09:42,740 --> 00:09:44,740
你何不到楼下大厅去发 信号会比较好
Why don't you go down to the lobby? You'll get a stronger signal.

278
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:46,540
-你好 -丽塔
- Oh. Hello. - Rita.

279
00:09:46,540 --> 00:09:48,220
-这是我女儿 克莱尔 -你好
-This is my daughter, Claire. - Hi.

280
00:09:48,300 --> 00:09:49,260
克莱尔 这位是丽塔
Claire, this is Rita.

281
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:51,020
我和你爸认识好多年了
Your dad and I go way back.

282
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:53,000
第一次见面的时候 我就告诉他
First time we met, I told him

283
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,120
他得进修一下"衣架"管理课程
he needed a course in "Hanger" Management.

284
00:09:56,309 --> 00:09:57,461
现在回想都挺逗的
It's still funny.

285
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,120
说真的吗
Seriously?

286
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,700
她老公是从事服装生意的
Her husband's in the garment business.

287
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,640
他给我做了套西服
He made me a suit.

288
00:10:01,740 --> 00:10:03,860
我做衣柜 他做衣柜里面的衣服
I make the closets, and he fills them.

289
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:04,820
天作之合
Match made in heaven.

290
00:10:04,980 --> 00:10:06,580
那个餐厅里的人都很难缠
Honey, they're kind of sticklers at that restaurant.

291
00:10:06,740 --> 00:10:08,840
要不你先去占座 我把这个放到屋里
Why don't you grab our table? I'll put this in the room.

292
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:11,020
好的 这就去
Uh, okay. Will do.

293
00:10:11,220 --> 00:10:12,500
非常高兴见到你
Um, really nice to meet you.

294
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:13,760
楼下见了
See you downstairs.

295
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:16,236
我其实想走楼梯
I actually am gonna take the stairs.

296
00:10:16,236 --> 00:10:17,972
电梯实在太慢了
That elevator is slow.

297
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,080
是我多想了
Hey, was it just me,

298
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,160
还是她看我的眼神确实有点怪
or was she looking at me weird?

299
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:24,760
我也有点感觉
I did kind of sense that.

300
00:10:24,860 --> 00:10:26,280
她不会是知道了我们的事情吧
You don't think she knows about our deal?

301
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,440
怎么会 那件事都过去20年了
How could she? It was 20 years ago.

302
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,940
何况我从来没告诉过别人
And I never told anyone.

303
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:36,560
她还会介意这个吗
Would she even care?

304
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:38,780
介意我试图拆散她和她嫁的那个男人吗
That I tried to get rid of the man she ended up marrying?

305
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:41,400
你又没有攻击那个男人
Well, it's not like you took a hit out on him.

306
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,900
你只不过是让我给他
You had me offer him a job

307
00:10:42,900 --> 00:10:44,300
在最好的州找了份工作
in the greatest state in the union.

308
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,200
好了 德克萨斯粉丝
Okay, Tex.

309
00:10:47,460 --> 00:10:50,580
我从没对谁说过 她怎么会知道
If I never said anything, how could she know?

310
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,940
我第一个找上的人不是你
You're not the first one I approached.

311
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:53,700
你只是第一个答应的而已
You're just the first one who said yes.

312
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:01,440
-我受够了 受够了 -拜托
- I'm done. I'm done - Come on.

313
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:03,640
求你了 扮演一下巴德 就一两天
Please, just be Bud -- for a couple days.

314
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,220
你可以干些杂活儿 然后或许
You can do some chores, maybe I can

315
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:06,720
我再呵斥你两句 装得更像点
berate you a little bit to really sell it.

316
00:11:06,780 --> 00:11:08,320
你听不出你的话有多过分吗
Do you hear how insane you sound?

317
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,320
让我干杂活儿
Chores?

318
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:10,680
好吧 你知道吗
All right, you know what?

319
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:12,640
你想怎么对付你奶奶随便你
You -- you deal with your grandmother however you want.

320
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:15,080
-我和莉莉要去找酒店住 -不行
- Lily and I will just go get a hotel room. - No, you can't.

321
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:16,400
好吧 没酒店就找汽车旅馆或粮仓
Fine. Motel, silo --

322
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,140
什么都行
whatever you got around here.

323
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:20,180
不 那个警报表示龙卷风这就要来了
No, that alarm means there's a tornado coming right now.

324
00:11:20,180 --> 00:11:21,368
我的天 莉莉在哪里
Oh, god. Well, where's lily?

325
00:11:21,460 --> 00:11:23,120
但愿她不会还在田里
I hope she's not still out in the field.

326
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:24,560
莉莉
Lil-y-y-y-y!

327
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:26,860
你不能像唤猪一样地叫她
You can't just call her like a pig!

328
00:11:26,860 --> 00:11:29,136
莉莉
Lil-y-y-y-y-y!

329
00:11:30,123 --> 00:11:31,120
好吧 只能在农场这样叫
Okay, this is just a farm thing,

330
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,060
回到城里大商场可不行
not, like, a mall thing.

331
00:11:32,060 --> 00:11:33,917
-你说什么 城市之声 -快走吧
- What's that, city voice? Hmm? - Just go.

332
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:40,040
这个缠得真够紧的
This is really in there good.

333
00:11:40,140 --> 00:11:41,180
让她离我远点
Get her off of me.

334
00:11:41,220 --> 00:11:42,500
她身上的傻气要渗透给我了
I'm getting dumb through osmosis.

335
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:43,920
我才没有渗透这种东西
I don't have osmosis.

336
00:11:44,890 --> 00:11:46,860
太好了 查克把披萨送来了
Oh, great. Chuck's here with the pizza.

337
00:11:46,860 --> 00:11:48,280
歌洛莉亚 你可以去开下门吗
Gloria, can you please get it?

338
00:11:48,620 --> 00:11:50,840
不行 你们两个得对彼此友善点
No. You two be nice to each other

339
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,140
自己解决
and figure it out.

340
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:56,460
你好 查克
Oh, hey, Chuck.

341
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,940
我没想到你今晚还要工作
I didn't think you'd be working tonight.

342
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,240
你好 你怎么会在这里
Hey. What are you doing here?

343
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:00,700
这里是我外公的家
Oh, this is my grandfather's house.

344
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:01,800
后院有游泳池 你会游泳吗
There's a pool. Do you swim?

345
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:02,740
看你这身材一定会
You look like you swim.

346
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:04,200
我确实会游
I do.

347
00:12:05,500 --> 00:12:06,300
谢谢
Oh, thanks.

348
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:09,260
你还好吧
You okay?

349
00:12:09,420 --> 00:12:11,200
还好 没事 有点抽筋而已
Oh, yeah. Totally. Just a cramp.

350
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:12,380
我经常锻炼 稍等一下
I work out. One second.

351
00:12:13,899 --> 00:12:15,891
-你个小... -闭嘴
- You little... - Shut up.

352
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:18,840
你好啊
Hey, you.

353
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:20,060
你好 棕眼美女
Hey, brown eyes.

354
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:24,800
好的 谢谢 再见
Okay, cool. Thanks. Bye.

355
00:12:27,140 --> 00:12:27,540
再见
Bye!

356
00:12:27,612 --> 00:12:28,448
-干嘛 -闭嘴 笨蛋
- What? - Shut up, dork.

357
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:31,500
别紧张 亲爱的
Don't be nervous, honey.

358
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,820
没有什么好害怕的
There's nothing to be scared of.

359
00:12:32,940 --> 00:12:35,080
放轻松 妈妈 别把屁股摔了
Take it easy, mama. Don't break a hip.

360
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,440
告诉你吧
I'm telling you right now.

361
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,960
我才不要假装成别人
I am not pretending to be something I'm not,

362
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,060
尤其是当着女儿的面
especially in front of our daughter.

363
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:42,140
我六年都不能当着你爸的面亲你
Oh, so I can't kiss you in front of your dad for six years,

364
00:12:42,140 --> 00:12:43,760
你就不能为了我忍两天吗
and you can't give me two days?

365
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:46,800
我们是为了不让老太太难过
We're saving an old lady some unnecessary upset.

366
00:12:46,940 --> 00:12:48,340
为什么不给她多点信任呢
Why don't you give her a little credit?

367
00:12:48,340 --> 00:12:50,400
她说不定比你想的更开明
She might be more open-minded than you think.

368
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:53,400
你个可爱的小中国娃
Well, you're a cute little Chinese thing.

369
00:12:53,483 --> 00:12:57,221
奶奶 其实她是越南人
Actually, gram, she's, uh, from Vietnam,

370
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:58,620
她叫莉莉
and her name's Lily.

371
00:12:59,340 --> 00:13:01,440
爸爸 我们还得在这呆多久
Dad, how long do we have to stay down here?

372
00:13:01,980 --> 00:13:02,540
"爸爸"
"Dad"?

373
00:13:04,220 --> 00:13:05,760
好吧 看来真没辙了
Okay, well, I guess there's no way around this.

374
00:13:06,003 --> 00:13:08,044
其 其实
Ac-- actually, ma'am...

375
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,360
她是我家的
...she's my kin.

376
00:13:09,620 --> 00:13:12,100
那你是有个中国妻子咯 巴德
So, you got a Chinese wife, Bud?

377
00:13:12,100 --> 00:13:13,760
不是 我去了趟越南
No, I-I-I went to vietnam,

378
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,940
自己领养了个娃
and I did myself some adopting,

379
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:20,380
现在我就孤身一人养着她
And now I'm raising her all by my lonesome.

380
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:23,940
我从没想到有生之年还能见识这种事
Well, I never thought I'd live long enough to see that.

381
00:13:24,192 --> 00:13:25,967
大家都没想到
None of us did.

382
00:13:25,980 --> 00:13:28,940
但我想世上最重要的就是家庭了
But I guess there's nothing more important than family...

383
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:31,440
不管这家庭是如何建立的
no matter how they come.

384
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,711
您真是太开明了
Well, that is mighty open-minded of you.

385
00:13:33,711 --> 00:13:36,480
有人就不懂分享这种进步
Some folks 'round these parts don't share that progressive--

386
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:39,060
这种进步的情感
I say progressive-- sensibility.

387
00:13:39,300 --> 00:13:40,840
青菜萝卜 各有所爱
To each his own.

388
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:43,060
但我确实希望
But I do wish I had another

389
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:45,880
能有这么个小不点儿来宠爱
little one like that to spoil.

390
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:49,340
要是我说你确实有个曾孙女呢
What if I told you you did have a great-grandbaby?

391
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:52,240
-什么 -小卡
- What? - Cam...

392
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,000
没关系 妈妈
It's okay, mama.

393
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:56,800
要是我说我恋爱了
What if I told you I was in love,

394
00:13:57,280 --> 00:14:00,500
而且我此生从未如此幸福
and that I've never been happier in my entire life,

395
00:14:00,500 --> 00:14:02,400
而且我就要结婚了呢
and that I'm about to get married?

396
00:14:02,620 --> 00:14:05,200
那简直是世上最好的消息
I can't think of anything better.

397
00:14:05,460 --> 00:14:08,160
要是我告诉你我的毕生至爱
And what if I told you the love of my life

398
00:14:08,580 --> 00:14:10,560
就是这个男人呢
is this man standing right here?

399
00:14:11,420 --> 00:14:14,220
难怪上帝要带给我们这场龙卷风
Then I'd know why god sent us this tornado.

400
00:14:14,728 --> 00:14:15,365
该死
Damn.

401
00:14:15,826 --> 00:14:18,660
最初的震惊之后 奶奶缓和了一些
After the initial shock, gram softened a bit.

402
00:14:18,660 --> 00:14:20,360
她甚至同意参加婚礼了
She even agreed to attend the wedding.

403
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:22,000
举着牌子站在场外抗议
Standing outside with a sign.

404
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,980
慢慢来 米奇尔 慢慢来
Baby steps, Mitchell. Baby steps.

405
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:28,560
然后 天线就
And... our antenna is...

406
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:30,700
-重新连上了 -赞
- reattached. - Yes!

407
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:33,200
这没用啊
Oh, this is useless.

408
00:14:33,340 --> 00:14:35,220
我不想听见这种话
Hey, I don't want to hear talk like that.

409
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:37,900
想鼓舞士气就想想阿波罗十三号
If you want inspiration, think about Apollo 13.

410
00:14:38,280 --> 00:14:40,600
杰第一次组装这模型的时候也没有放弃
Jay didn't give up when he first put together this model.

411
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,860
这很难很复杂 而且那时候
It was hard and complicated, and back then,

412
00:14:42,860 --> 00:14:44,560
说明书上的字也很小
the print on the instructions was tiny,

413
00:14:44,740 --> 00:14:45,940
可他坚持下去了
but he persevered.

414
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:48,420
而且 真的阿波罗十三号上的宇航员
Also, the astronauts on the actual Apollo 13

415
00:14:48,420 --> 00:14:50,440
身处险境时也没有放弃
didn't give up when their actual lives were in danger.

416
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:52,440
是的 但他们有很多人帮忙
Them, too, but they had a lot of other people helping them out.

417
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:53,280
我们只能靠自己
We're on our own here.

418
00:14:53,740 --> 00:14:55,040
我知道我们需要什么东西
Okay, I figured out what we need

419
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:56,860
来重新组装这该死的着陆舱了
to reattach that damn landing module.

420
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,140
胶水不行
Glue won't work.

421
00:14:58,220 --> 00:15:00,220
我们需要根非常细的长丝
We need a very thin filament--

422
00:15:00,740 --> 00:15:01,560
比线还细的
thinner than thread.

423
00:15:02,479 --> 00:15:04,141
我知道什么能行
I know what will work.

424
00:15:05,260 --> 00:15:06,900
我得离开一下
Well, I need to go check on something.

425
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:09,260
我跟我的女伴说我去去就回
I told my date I'd be back in a jiff.

426
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,040
去去就回
Back in a jiff.

427
00:15:11,780 --> 00:15:13,140
只能等了
Nothing to do but wait.

428
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:15,740
我们为何自己乱了阵脚 菲尔
Why are we making ourselves crazy, Phil?

429
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:18,300
不知道 我就是不想让杰失望
I don't know. I just hate disappointing Jay so much.

430
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:20,480
他的确不是容易取悦的人
He is not an easy guy to please.

431
00:15:20,940 --> 00:15:22,960
我知道 可一旦成功就很幸福 是吧
I know, but when you do, it's pretty sweet, ain't it?

432
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,180
必须的
Sure is.

433
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:26,780
你很幸运有这么个老爸
You're lucky to have a dad like that.

434
00:15:27,700 --> 00:15:30,060
很难不受伤啊 儿子
Hard not to be hurt by that, son.

435
00:15:31,640 --> 00:15:33,720
我怎么以前没发现你喘气这么大声
How have I never noticed how loud you breathe?

436
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:35,500
别自责了 那需要你
Aw, don't beat yourself up-- that'd require you

437
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:36,960
注意到你自己以外的事情
to notice something that isn't about you.

438
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:38,360
天呐 你真失败
Oh, my god, you are such a loser!

439
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:38,840
我可不能整天跟你在一起
I can't be stuck to you all day!

440
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:41,960
够了 我听不下去了
Okay, that's it! I cannot listen to this anymore!

441
00:15:42,073 --> 00:15:44,599
我要把你俩剪开
I'm going to cut you two out of there.

442
00:15:44,599 --> 00:15:45,959
不 歌洛莉亚 我的头发
No! Gloria, no! My hair!

443
00:15:46,073 --> 00:15:48,000
-太晚了 -好吧 剪我的就好
- Too late! - Okay, okay! Just cut mine.

444
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,760
没错 剪她的 等等 为什么
Yeah, cut hers! Wait. Why?

445
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:52,020
反正也没人关心我长什么样
No one cares what I look like, anyway.

446
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:53,740
你才不是真的这么想
You don't really think that.

447
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:54,980
多少有一点
Yeah, well, kind of.

448
00:15:55,060 --> 00:15:56,880
你没看到查克看你的眼神吗
You didn't see the way that Chuck was looking at you?

449
00:15:57,680 --> 00:15:59,480
等等 你真觉得我对你是个威胁吗
Wait, you actually think I'm a threat?

450
00:15:59,883 --> 00:16:01,929
我不会说出来的
I'm not gonna say that out loud.

451
00:16:02,109 --> 00:16:03,647
这真窝心
Aww, that's so sweet.

452
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:05,540
要是我有男朋友
Well, if I ever had a boyfriend,

453
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:07,540
我绝对不会让他和你独处五秒的
I wouldn't trust him with you for five seconds.

454
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:10,860
好了 结束吧
Okay. Let's finish this job.

455
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:11,862
歌洛莉亚 别 不能剪
Gloria, no, you can't cut--

456
00:16:11,862 --> 00:16:13,445
搞定了
And there you go.

457
00:16:13,660 --> 00:16:15,280
就这样 小菜一碟
That's it. That was easy.

458
00:16:15,700 --> 00:16:17,160
你为什么等了一小时才这样做
Why did you wait an hour to do this?

459
00:16:17,260 --> 00:16:19,160
你们为什么等了15年才那么做呢
Why did you wait 15 years to do that?

460
00:16:19,460 --> 00:16:20,900
至少这样 大家的秀发
At least this way, nothing bad happened

461
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:22,060
都不会受损
to anyone's pretty hair.

462
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:30,520
女儿 我没听到你进来
Oh, honey. I didn't hear you come in.

463
00:16:31,060 --> 00:16:33,260
-晚上过得如何 -这么说吧
- How was the rest of your night? - Let's see.

464
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,940
在你放了我鸽子之后
After you bailed on me,

465
00:16:34,940 --> 00:16:37,458
衣柜乌托邦的马可一直冲我喋喋不休
Mark from Closetopia yakked my ear off,

466
00:16:37,458 --> 00:16:39,504
还说我长得像海蒂·克鲁姆
and then told me I look like Heidi Klum,

467
00:16:39,504 --> 00:16:41,280
这简直是赤裸裸的挑逗
which is such an obvious come-on.

468
00:16:41,280 --> 00:16:41,980
马可是同性恋
Mark's gay.

469
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,860
这样的话 今晚糟透了
Well, in that case, my night stank.

470
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:45,180
我没有放你鸽子
And I didn't bail.

471
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:47,080
这里很多人跟我很熟 他们把我拉走的
I know a lot of people here. They pulled me away.

472
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:49,220
这睡袍棒极了
Hey, these robes are terrific.

473
00:16:49,260 --> 00:16:50,640
衣柜里有你一件
You know, there's one for you in the closet.

474
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:51,340
你一定要穿上感受一下
You ought to put it on.

475
00:16:51,420 --> 00:16:52,300
我不想穿浴袍
I don't want a robe.

476
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:55,120
爸 你今晚是不是在躲我
Dad, were you avoiding me tonight?

477
00:16:55,300 --> 00:16:56,480
我为什么要躲你
Why would I avoid you?

478
00:16:56,820 --> 00:16:58,840
相信我 柔软的像黄油一样
Trust me -- soft, like butter.

479
00:16:58,980 --> 00:16:59,740
就在那里挂着
Right in there.

480
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:01,300
不要非让我问出口
Don't make me ask.

481
00:17:01,300 --> 00:17:02,360
你在说什么
What are you talking about?

482
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:05,380
20年前你和丽塔
You and Rita 20 years ago --

483
00:17:05,380 --> 00:17:08,260
-没什么 我都知道了 -天呐
- It's okay. I know. - Oh, geez.

484
00:17:08,260 --> 00:17:10,280
我理解 这种事时有发生
I get it. Things happen.

485
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:12,000
-真的么 -事情过去很久了
- Really? - It was a long time ago.

486
00:17:12,100 --> 00:17:13,320
好吧 感谢理解
Well, I appreciate it.

487
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:15,740
我只能说我并不以此为傲
I just want to say I'm not proud of it.

488
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:18,380
如果那时我能像现在这样了解他
If I had known him then like I know him now,

489
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:20,560
我绝不会试图把菲尔从你身边赶走
I never would have tried to get rid of Phil.

490
00:17:20,860 --> 00:17:21,340
晚安
Good night.

491
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:28,220
把菲尔赶走 你在说什么
"Get rid of Phil"? What are you talking about?

492
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:29,380
你又在说什么
What are you talking about?

493
00:17:29,460 --> 00:17:30,700
你和丽塔的婚外情
You and Rita had an affair.

494
00:17:30,700 --> 00:17:32,420
不 我们没有 那也太离谱了
No, we didn't. That's crazy.

495
00:17:33,316 --> 00:17:34,913
好吧 晚安
Well, okay, good night.

496
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:37,040
把菲尔赶走 你那么说是什么意思
"Get rid of phil" -- what does that even mean?

497
00:17:37,140 --> 00:17:38,840
没什么意思 你们刚开始约会
It doesn't mean anything. You had just started dating.

498
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:40,180
你知道我一直不喜欢那个家伙
You know I was never hot on the guy.

499
00:17:40,500 --> 00:17:41,840
我让丽塔在德克萨斯州
I told Rita to offer him

500
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:43,040
给他找了个销售职位
a sales job in Texas.

501
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:45,020
我记得 但那不是在我们约会的阶段
I remember that, but that wasn't when we were dating.

502
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:47,180
-我们都订婚了 -那不重要
- We were engaged. - Doesn't matter.

503
00:17:47,620 --> 00:17:48,900
菲尔也没有接受那份工作
Phil didn't take the job anyway.

504
00:17:49,060 --> 00:17:50,300
如果一定要说有什么后果
If anything, my little test

505
00:17:50,300 --> 00:17:51,560
我的小测试证明了他有多爱你
proved how much he loved you.

506
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,180
不用客气 我们明早再谈
You're welcome. We'll talk in the morning.

507
00:17:53,180 --> 00:17:55,220
你怎么能这样 还敢说"不用客气"
Oh, how dare you -- "You're welcom" please.

508
00:17:55,220 --> 00:17:56,680
我无法和你共处一室了
Oh, I can't even be in the same room with you.

509
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,275
-我的外套在哪 -克莱尔
- Where is my coat? - Uh, Claire.

510
00:17:58,506 --> 00:17:59,324
真是不敢相信
Ugh, unbelievable.

511
00:17:59,324 --> 00:18:00,426
我不喜欢我的女婿
"I don't like my son-in-law,

512
00:18:00,426 --> 00:18:02,220
所以我要把他打发到德克萨斯去
so I'm gonna ship him off to Texas."

513
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:04,220
爸 你这样处理问题真"成熟"
Real mature way to deal with your problems, dad.

514
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:06,300
-我明白你的意思 -是啊 真成熟
- I get that point. - Yeah. Real mature.

515
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:09,520
-这样整人也很成熟 -这是传统
- That's real mature, too. - That's tradition.

516
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:12,520
-那是个骷髅 -在衣橱里 我知道
- It's the skeleton... - In the closet. Oh, I get it.

517
00:18:12,620 --> 00:18:15,720
我非常抱歉 但在你冲出去之前
I'm really sorry, but before you go storming out of here,

518
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:18,560
你想不想谈谈几年前我接到的
you want to talk about a certain phone call I got

519
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:20,280
一通移民局打来的电话
from immigration a few years ago?

520
00:18:20,515 --> 00:18:22,380
那时我刚开始和歌洛莉亚约会
I had just started dating Gloria.

521
00:18:22,380 --> 00:18:24,760
他们说有人匿名举报
They were acting on an anonymous tip.

522
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:28,120
时候不早了
It's very late.

523
00:18:29,671 --> 00:18:31,212
明天还有不少事要做
We have a very big day tomorrow.

524
00:18:32,340 --> 00:18:35,260
克莱尔 我现在越来越喜欢菲尔了
You know, Claire, I've really come to like Phil.

525
00:18:35,600 --> 00:18:36,440
我知道
I know.

526
00:18:36,820 --> 00:18:38,200
而且讽刺的是
And the irony is,

527
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,600
他会很喜欢这个骷髅的梗
he would really love that skeleton gag.

528
00:18:40,600 --> 00:18:41,829
你可以在他身上试试
Try it out on him. You got

529
00:18:41,829 --> 00:18:43,300
明年的会议之前骷髅由你来保管
to take care of that thing till next year.

530
00:18:43,300 --> 00:18:44,080
天哪
Oh, god.

531
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,640
等等 在你关灯之前
Wait, before you turn that out,

532
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:47,320
我们得确认一下没什么需要谈的了吧
have we talked about everything we need to?

533
00:18:47,504 --> 00:18:50,407
因为我想把一切都说开
'cause I want everything out in the clear here.

534
00:18:51,340 --> 00:18:52,420
是的 没有了
Yeah. We have.

535
00:18:54,780 --> 00:18:55,740
晚安
Good night.

536
00:19:01,900 --> 00:19:04,900
大概15年前我确实和丽塔亲热过一次
I did make out with Rita once about 15 years ago.

537
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:05,900
晚安
Good night.

538
00:19:08,934 --> 00:19:09,870
好
Okay.

539
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:11,980
剩下的就是
All that's left...

540
00:19:11,980 --> 00:19:16,100
要把着陆舱连接到驾驶舱上
is to reattach the lander to the command module.

541
00:19:16,780 --> 00:19:18,180
我们只有一次机会 伙计们
We got one shot at this, fellas.

542
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:21,510
如果失败了 杰一回到家就会发疯的 对吧
If we fail, jay's gonna burn up on re-entry into this house. Am I right?

543
00:19:22,180 --> 00:19:23,480
一次搞定 儿子
Hole in one, son!

544
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:24,180
谢谢 老爸
Thanks, dad.

545
00:19:24,820 --> 00:19:25,980
孩子们 如果这事搞砸了
Boys, if this thing goes sideways,

546
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:27,260
我不想你们亲眼看到
I don't want you to be here to see it.

547
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:29,200
-所以快走 -但爸爸
- So go on. - But, dad --

548
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:30,600
不 听我的
No, you listen to me!

549
00:19:41,175 --> 00:19:42,082
好的 菲尔
Okay, Phil.

550
00:19:43,667 --> 00:19:45,082
好吧 菲利普
Okay, Philip.

551
00:19:45,700 --> 00:19:46,160
稳一点
Steady.

552
00:19:47,560 --> 00:19:48,480
他要开始了
He's locked in.

553
00:19:53,137 --> 00:19:54,373
现在不是紧张的时候
Not now, nerves.

554
00:19:57,822 --> 00:19:58,682
稳住
Hold.

555
00:19:58,920 --> 00:19:59,260
稳住
Hold.

556
00:20:01,860 --> 00:20:02,660
当个英雄
Be a hero.

557
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:03,820
带她回家
Bring her home.

558
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:05,780
我看我还是打车走吧
I guess I'll call a cab.

559
00:20:05,818 --> 00:20:06,914
再见 珍宁
So long, Jeanine.

560
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:12,180
难道 这是
Is it? Is --

561
00:20:12,180 --> 00:20:15,020
完成了
It is!

562
00:20:15,176 --> 00:20:16,466
成功溅落
Splashdown!

563
00:20:21,577 --> 00:20:23,717
狗娘养的 他成功了
Son of a bitch, he did it.

564
00:20:28,896 --> 00:20:31,388
歌洛莉亚 快来
Yeah! Gloria, get in here!

565
00:20:31,388 --> 00:20:32,346
快来
There we go!

566
00:20:32,913 --> 00:20:34,740
-爸 你成功了 -是啊 成功了
- Dad, you did it! - Yes, I did!

567
00:20:34,740 --> 00:20:37,520
太棒了 太棒了
I love it! I love it!

568
00:20:37,840 --> 00:20:39,260
太棒了
I love it!

569
00:20:48,300 --> 00:20:50,620
菲尔 亲爱的 快上床
Phil, honey. Come to bed.

570
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:52,800
这浴袍滑的像黄油一样
This robe feels like butter.

571
00:20:58,858 --> 00:21:00,256
太怀念了 亲爱的
I missed this, honey.

572
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:03,060
这瑜伽课可真是物超所值啊
That yoga's really paying off.

573
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:05,340
悠着点 宝贝
Hey, whoa. Slow down, baby.

574
00:21:05,420 --> 00:21:07,100
发动机可还没烧热呢
You can't gun a cold engine.

575
00:21:08,519 --> 00:21:10,944
但如果你...那床上的是...
But if you're -- then who's --

576
00:21:11,380 --> 00:21:12,280
你什么时候发现的
When did you know?

577
00:21:12,300 --> 00:21:13,780
它没有抱怨我穿着袜子
When it didn't complain about my socks.

578
00:21:14,253 --> 00:21:16,120
你检查过衣橱了 是不是
You checked the closet, didn't you?

579
00:21:16,120 --> 00:21:17,120
每晚睡前都会检查
Every night before bed.

580
00:21:17,807 --> 00:21:19,700
我真的不懂 这好傻
I really don't understand it. It's so silly.

581
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:21,560
我是说 如果真的有人想杀你
I mean, if somebody really wanted to kill you,

582
00:21:21,600 --> 00:21:23,420
很明显他们会藏在床下
obviously they'd just hide under the bed.

583
00:21:24,280 --> 00:21:24,900
晚安
Good night.

584
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:26,680
妈的
Damn it.
